{"id":"46778a95d3c9618d","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound.md","title":"鸽巢 CNF 的归结指数下界","display":"thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound — 鸽巢 CNF 的归结指数下界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound","aliases":["28-thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound"],"display":"thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound — 鸽巢 CNF 的归结指数下界","depends_on":["[[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]","[[28-df-resolution]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"310","source_pdf_pages":"336","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound — 鸽巢 CNF 的归结指数下界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b774ede033a2483d\" href=\"?note=b774ede033a2483d\" title=\"28-df-pigeonhole-cnf\">28-df-pigeonhole-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fced6234cc12ca5b\" href=\"?note=fced6234cc12ca5b\" title=\"28-df-resolution\">28-df-resolution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"310"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"336"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(N\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\ge2\">\\(N\\ge2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\mathrm{PHP}_{N,N-1}\">\\(F=\\mathrm{PHP}_{N,N-1}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b774ede033a2483d\" href=\"?note=b774ede033a2483d\" title=\"28-df-pigeonhole-cnf\">28-df-pigeonhole-cnf</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResRef},|\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ResRef},|\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fced6234cc12ca5b\" href=\"?note=fced6234cc12ca5b\" title=\"28-df-resolution\">28-df-resolution</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\;(\\operatorname{ResRef}(F,\\pi)\\Longrightarrow|\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\ge2^{N/20}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\;(\\operatorname{ResRef}(F,\\pi)\\Longrightarrow|\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\ge2^{N/20}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>与原书变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>（鸽子数）对应的是此处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>，洞数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N-1\">\\(N-1\\)</span>。保留原书明确的指数常数，不将指数误写成多项式。已逐项比对 Theorem 15.1 陈述；瓶颈论证及 Lemma 15.2 的完整证明尚未独立逐步审计。输入子句按需列行不影响下界：任一鸽子子句或洞冲突子句缺失时，该输入子集均可满足，故可靠反驳必须使用全部输入子句；任意顺序可重排为原书输入子句前缀。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 15.1，印刷 p.310 / PDF p.336。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n<p>R6证据边界：瓶颈引理与完整指数下界证明尚未独立核验。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-pigeonhole-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"b774ede033a2483d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"fced6234cc12ca5b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-resolution]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pigeonhole-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"b774ede033a2483d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N\\in\\mathbb N$，$N\\ge2$；$F=\\mathrm{PHP}_{N,N-1}$ 来自 [[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]。$\\operatorname{ResRef},|\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 来自 [[28-df-resolution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"fced6234cc12ca5b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N\\in\\mathbb N$，$N\\ge2$；$F=\\mathrm{PHP}_{N,N-1}$ 来自 [[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]。$\\operatorname{ResRef},|\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 来自 [[28-df-resolution]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\mathrm{PHP}_{N,N-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResRef},|\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\pi\\;(\\operatorname{ResRef}(F,\\pi)\\Longrightarrow|\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\ge2^{N/20}).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"N-1","display":false}],"bytes":1700,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第15章：证明复杂性：[[28-df-propositional-proof-system]]、[[28-thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp]]、[[28-df-resolution]]、[[28-thm-resolution-soundness-completeness]]、[[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]、[[28-thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["b774ede033a2483d","fced6234cc12ca5b"]}